*.md
!README.md
# Skill instructions are read from disk at runtime (builtinSkillsDir(),
# demo skill sources in scripts/seed-demo.mjs), not just documentation.
!app/idp/features/cortex-cowork/skills/**/*.md
!demo/skills/**/*.md
docs

# Python microservices (services/<name>/) each build from their OWN context
# (docker-compose.yml: `build: context: services/<name>`, a completely
# separate `docker build` invocation with its own .dockerignore lookup
# scoped to that subdirectory) — irrelevant to and only bloating the
# context sent to the daemon for THIS (root) Dockerfile's Next.js image.
# This line does not affect the services/* builds themselves.
services
